      "runtime": "One universal Settlements implementation on logical integrated/dedicated servers; exact town/resident/native-content admission retained. Coin treasury only while optional Economy is enabled, otherwise independent EmeraldTreasury. Native optional Recruits/Xaero adapters require actual installed dependency; Workers excluded.",
